  "Software Details": "Software detaljer",
  "Elevate your eCommerceGo SaaS platform with the Countdown Timer Module, a dynamic tool designed to create excitement and urgency around your upcoming sales events. With this feature, admins can easily set up countdown timers for sales directly from the store settings page, enhancing customer engagement and boosting sales.": "Løft din eCommerceGo SaaS-platform med Countdown Timer Module, et dynamisk værktøj designet til at skabe spænding og haster omkring dine kommende salgsbegivenheder. ",
